#
# Both origins are web apps on one App Service plan since 1.0.0.156, reached
# over HTTPS (ADR: One plan, two sites). Until the stopped container groups are
# deleted, the way back is `az container start` on both and these two origins
# in place of the two below:
#   http://theyard-cosmos-ss-zmnetj67bn5h2.westus2.azurecontainer.io:8080
#   http://theyard-ss-zmnetj67bn5h2.westus2.azurecontainer.io:8080
# Every page is the bare path with a query naming the view, the vehicle or the
# document, and the rendering service draws it (ADR: A rendering service beside the API); each
# domain's page goes to the service under that site's name, and everything else,
# the bundle, the photographs and /api, to that site's API as before. The query
# goes with a 200 rewrite. /index.html is still the API's own page, drawn in the
# browser, which is the way round while the service is down.
